  "stageId": "a003_st04",
  "title": "爱某个人",
  "storyCode": "OF-ST4",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "34afe3be7d9ce872cfc2138a0fae1722a850ec8883c160681c0da4800f45b140",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你们都知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "这样简单的骗局，又能欺瞒多久呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
      "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
      "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
      "text": "啊，LIVE快开始了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女士们，先生们，欢迎你们来到黑曜石节！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们过得愉快吗！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观众",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（狂热的欢呼声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多么热情的回应，但是我要告诉你们，你们还没有见识到黑曜石节真正的魅力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今晚，所有邀请的音乐家们将齐聚一堂，为你们带来无上的听觉与视觉的盛宴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一个主场舞台，四个大舞台，十二个小舞台，四十位来自各领域的知名音乐家，十八个小时，将会一直演出直到明天的太阳升起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告诉我，你们准备好了吗！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观众",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（疯狂的欢呼声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "......锡兰告诉了我火山的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "所以你不仅篡改了火山监测数据，而且宣称小姐要散布谣言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为你我都知道啊。赫尔曼做的那些事，我们都知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道什么的话，就说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克洛宁，说下去吧。但你也要把我“因事务出差”的时候，你到底做了些什么，全都说出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "爸——父亲？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么在这里？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很意外吗，克洛宁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我明令禁止了从火山中开采黑曜石之后，在市场上依然有新开采的黑曜石流通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "开采队很多次出现在火山口，却没有人向我报告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最终开采的货物经过多次转送，已经被送到了市政厅的废弃仓库。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我下令拨款为汐斯塔出现的矿石病患者提供各方面资助后，市里反而出现了各种他们受到的不公待遇的流言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些事情有没有让你意外过？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些事情让我意外到愤怒难安！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为了找到这些事情的真相，我放出了离开城市的消息，让黑作为我的下属替我在城市调查真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
      "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
      "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "看来，只要调查一下这些记录和相关人员就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "赫拉格爷爷，你们也平安无事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真遗憾，克洛宁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原本，我是不介意和你分享一些东西的，但你太急躁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？急躁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我这些不都是为了这个城市，不都是你教我的吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "十年前的巴鲁一家，八年前的电视塔倒塌案，还有你如何说服......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，我想是不是用吞并更好一些？你是如何吞并塔拉克部族的，我都看在眼里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的一切都是从您那里学来的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盈利，处理。手段不重要，结果才是重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个破烂的乡下，你以为我为它付出了多少心血，换来的又有什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好不容易因为黑曜石带来的收益，却要全部变成给那些根本治不好的病人的补贴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "与其如此，还不如就让火山爆发好了！而我只需要保护好汐斯塔的物资和财产，一样可以东山再起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我做过许多事。但我不会拿汐斯塔做赌注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "矿工和研究者的生命，全城的生命都被你视作什么了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克洛宁，你被解雇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈糊涂的老头，那可还说不清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多亏你的喋喋不休，我的人手已经全都到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？等等，我怎么烤糊了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "角峰叔！你来看一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "搞什么，感觉温度流向都变了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯嗯嗯！海浪好大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸！海浪变得好大哦！也太大了吧哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "怎么不说话了，你刚刚明明话很多的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我在想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "唔，像你这样的人居然还有这么沉默寡言的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我感觉我的大脑有些激动，先让我冷静一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "不是，虽然我不是地质学家，也不懂什么源石物理啊高能源石技艺啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "高能源石技艺和火山生态学是两回事，肯定没办法解决我们现在的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "硬要说的话，造一个巨大的容器把所有能量抽出来，也许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "可这种法术，就连我也要编个好几年。不可能的，完全不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "我说了我不懂啊！但现在的情况，很不妙吧！非常有问题啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "是不妙啊！你以为什么情况下我才会激动啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "想想办法啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我不是在想吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "必须赶紧把这件事告诉博士才行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "那就拜托你好好想想了，我立刻去发报！可别被热昏头脑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "我很冷静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "刚才你才说很激动来着！而且你头发都烧着了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "唔，生态圈恶化导致的地质演变......哼，还有救！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
